      <h2 id="openshift-lightspeed-web-console_capabilities-web-console" class="group scroll-mt-20">Red Hat OpenShift Lightspeed in the web console<a href="#openshift-lightspeed-web-console_capabilities-web-console" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
